Local patches carried on top of upstream prism 0.17.3 (github.com/ethindp/prism).

Regenerate with:
  diff -u <stock-0.17.3-file> <patched-file>
for each path below. Everything here is Windows-only; nothing changes the C ABI.

 (1) SEH-guarded initialize() during backend selection
     source/frozen_registry.cpp   — create_best() / acquire_best()
     source/prism.cpp             — prism_backend_initialize(), for hosts that
                                    walk the registry themselves (the mod does)
 (2) ZDSR / PC-Talker / BoyPC client DLLs resolved at runtime instead of via a
     .def import library plus /delayload
     source/backends/raw/dynamic_library.h   (added)
     source/backends/raw/{zdsr,pc_talker,boy_pc_reader}.h
     source/backends/{zdsr,pc_talker,boy_pc_reader}.cpp
     cmake/PrismPlatformWindows.cmake
     defs/{zdsr,zdsr32,pc_talker,pc_talker32,boy_pc_reader,boy_pc_reader32}.def  (deleted)
 (3) CMAKE_C_STANDARD pinned to 17 — build-environment only
     cmake/PrismOptions.cmake

